 110:     - Draw straight horizontal or vertical segments between mapped positions of
 111:       adjacent sprite pixels, then fill any enclosed background region inside
 112:       those drawn segments.
 113: 
 114:     Key insight:
 115:     The outside sprite is a miniature line/fill diagram for the frame interior,
 116:     not a bitmap to scale by block replication.
 117:     """
